  "body": "Your first home or the perfect downsize? Either way, this one is a beauty! Freshly renovated and beautifully presented, this two-bedroom home delivers the comfort, sunshine and easy living you've been searching for. Set on a half share of over 1,000sqm, with a fully fenced, north-facing section, there's room to enjoy the outdoors as well as space for the dog. With a new roof last year, plus a brand-new deck, carpet and fresh paintwork completed over recent months, all the hard work has been done. Simply move in, and make yourself at home. Our seller has their sights set on securing their next home, so this is your chance to make a move of your own!\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Two generous double bedrooms\r\n* Modern kitchen and open-plan living\r\n* Sunny north-facing deck out front and entertaining deck out back \r\n* Fully fenced section with room for the pets \r\n* Fresh paintwork, new carpet and a new deck\r\n* Roof was replaced in April 2025\r\n* Carport plus additional off-street parking\r\n* Easy indoor-outdoor flow for relaxed everyday living\r\n* Half share of a generous 1,007sqm land area \r\n* Convenient to the upcoming Penlink connection access \r\n\r\nWith shops, schools, public transport, beaches and parks all within easy reach, this is a location that makes everyday life that little bit easier. Enjoy a morning coffee in the sunshine, and weekend walks by the water. Whether you're buying your first home, simplifying life or securing a smart property investment, the combination of modern presentation, outdoor space and convenience is hard to overlook.\r\n\r\nWith the ongoing construction of Penlink set to improve accessibility to this desirable coastal community, now is the time to buy here. \r\n\r\nDon't let this one slip through your fingers. If you're searching in this price bracket, make sure this home is on your viewing list. \r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 10th December from 3:00pm (unless sold prior) \r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: (link to come) \r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
